review_comments.body:
This line assumes all request bodies should be JSON stringified, but the body could be a Buffer, string, or other data type. This will break for non-JSON payloads like form data or binary content.
```suggestion
      let requestBodyBuffer;
      if (resolvedOptions.body != null) {
        if (Buffer.isBuffer(resolvedOptions.body)) {
          requestBodyBuffer = resolvedOptions.body;
        } else if (typeof resolvedOptions.body === 'string') {
          requestBodyBuffer = Buffer.from(resolvedOptions.body, 'utf8');
        } else if (typeof resolvedOptions.body === 'object') {
          requestBodyBuffer = Buffer.from(JSON.stringify(resolvedOptions.body), 'utf8');
        } // else: unsupported type, skip
      }
```

