review_comments.body:
The condition `someString.length > 0` incorrectly excludes empty strings. If an empty string is a valid value to submit, this will silently skip it. The original logic `someString.length` would include empty strings (evaluating to 0/falsy was intentional). Verify if empty strings should be allowed or change to `someString.length >= 0` to match original behavior.
```suggestion
    addValueToData("someString", someString, true);
    addValueToData("someNumber", someNumber, !isNaN(someNumber));
    if (files.length) addValueToData("someSmallFile", files[0], true);
    addValueToData("nested.someString", nestedString, true);
```

